d]] [[stood|stand]] [[a]] [[young]] [[gentleman]] [[with]] [[the]] [[same]] [[nose]] [[and]] [[a]] [[shy]] [[smile]]. [[To]] Ngoc, [[he]] [[was|be]] [[a]] [[stranger]]. \`[[That]] [[is|be]] [[your]] [[Uncle]] Son,\` [[said|say]] Grandpa. \`[[Their]] [[marriage]] [[began|begin]] [[on]] [[the]] [[happiest|happy]] [[day]] [[this]] [[house]] [[has|have]] [[seen|see]].\``,`vn`:`Tr\u00ean c\u00f9ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh c\u01b0\u1edbi. C\u00f4 d\u00e2u l\u00e0 m\u1eb9, tr\u00f4ng r\u1ea5t tr\u1ebb, m\u1eb7c chi\u1ebfc v\u00e1y d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng. \u0110\u1ee9ng c\u1ea1nh m\u1eb9 l\u00e0 b\u1ed1, t\u00f3c v\u1eabn c\u00f2n d\u00e0y. V\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee9ng c\u1ea1nh b\u1ed1 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ch\u00e0ng trai l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1, c\u00f3 c\u00e1i m\u0169i gi\u1ed1ng h\u1ec7t b\u1ed1 v\u00e0 n\u1ee5 c\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ebdn l\u1ebdn. V\u1edbi Ng\u1ecdc, \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1ea1. \`\u0110\u1ea5y l\u00e0 ch\u00fa S\u01a1n c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \`Ng\u00e0y b\u1ed1 m\u1eb9 ch\u00e1u th\u00e0nh v\u1ee3 th\u00e0nh ch\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 ng\u00e0y vui nh\u1ea5t m\u00e0 ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 n\u00e0y t\u1eebng c\u00f3.\``},{`en`:`[[Under]] [[the]] [[photo]] [[was|be]] [[a]] [[yellow]] [[school]] [[form]] [[from]] Son's [[childhood]], [[when]] [[the]] [[boys|boy]] [[were|be]] [[aged]] [[nine]] [[and]] [[thirteen]]. [[In]] [[careful]] [[letters|letter]], [[it]] [[said|say]]: \`[[Name]]: Tran Son. [[Age]]: 9. [[Sex]]: [[male]]. [[Best]] [[friend]]: [[my]] [[brother]] Hung. [[Enemy]]: [[my]] [[brother]] Hung, [[when]] [[he]] [[takes|take]] [[my]] [[bike]].\` Ngoc [[laughed|laugh]]. \`[[Best]] [[friends|friend]] [[and]] [[enemies|enemy]] [[at]] [[the]] [[same]] [[time]]?\` \`[[Like]] [[all]] [[brothers|brother]],\` [[said|say]] Grandpa. \`[[Their]] [[friendship]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[loudest|loud]] [[thing]] [[in]] [[this]] [[house]].\``,`vn`:`D\u01b0\u1edbi t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u1edd phi\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 ng\u1ea3 v\u00e0ng t\u1eeb th\u1eddi ch\u00fa S\u01a1n c\u00f2n \u0111i h\u1ecdc, khi hai anh em m\u1edbi ch\u00edn v\u00e0 m\u01b0\u1eddi ba tu\u1ed5i. Ch\u1eef vi\u1ebft n\u1eafn n\u00f3t: \`H\u1ecd t\u00ean: Tr\u1ea7n S\u01a1n. Tu\u1ed5i: 9. Gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh: nam. B\u1ea1n th\u00e2n nh\u1ea5t: anh H\u00f9ng c\u1ee7a em. K\u1ebb th\u00f9: anh H\u00f9ng c\u1ee7a em, nh\u1eefng l\u00fac anh l\u1ea5y xe \u0111\u1ea1p c\u1ee7a em.\` Ng\u1ecdc b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`V\u1eeba l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n nh\u1ea5t, v\u1eeba l\u00e0 k\u1ebb th\u00f9 \u1ea1?\` \`Anh em nh\u00e0 n\u00e0o ch\u1eb3ng th\u1ebf,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \`T\u00ecnh b\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a hai \u0111\u1ee9a l\u00e0 th\u1ee9 \u1ed3n \u00e0o nh\u1ea5t c\u00e1i nh\u00e0 n\u00e0y.\``},{`en`:`[[At]] [[the]] [[bottom]] [[was|be]] [[a]] [[letter]]. \`Son [[wrote|write]] [[this]] [[eleven]] [[years|year]] [[ago]], [[the]] [[week]] [[after]] [[the]] [[big]] [[argument]],\` [[said|say]] Grandpa [[quietly]]. \`[[It]] [[was|be]] [[his]] [[last]] [[letter]], [[and]] [[nobody]] [[else]] [[has|have]] [[read]] [[it]].\` Ngoc [[read]] [[it]] [[slowly]].`,`vn`:`D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e1y h\u1ed9p l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u00e1 th\u01b0. \`Ch\u00fa S\u01a1n vi\u1ebft l\u00e1 th\u01b0 n\u00e0y m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, m\u1ed9t tu\u1ea7n sau tr\u1eadn c\u00e3i nhau to,\` \u00f4ng kh\u1ebd n\u00f3i. \`\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 l\u00e1 th\u01b0 cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng c\u1ee7a ch\u00fa, v\u00e0 ngo\u00e0i \u00f4ng ra ch\u01b0a ai \u0111\u1ecdc n\u00f3.\` Ng\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ecdc th\u1eadt ch\u1eadm.`},{`en`:`\`[[Dear]] [[Dad]], [[I]] [[am|be]] [[sorry]] [[for]] [[the]] [[things|thing]] [[I]] [[said|say]] [[to]] Hung. [[We]] [[were|be]] [[both]] [[angry]], [[and]] [[now]] [[we]] [[are|be]] [[both]] [[too]] [[proud]]. [[I]] [[have]] [[some]] [[news]]. [[I]] [[am|be]] [[engaged]] [[to]] [[a]] [[kind]] [[girl]] [[from]] [[the]] [[mountains|mountain]]. [[I]] [[want]] [[to]] [[bring]] [[her]] [[home]] [[to]] [[meet]] [[you]] [[all]], [[but]] [[not]] [[while]] Hung [[is|be]] [[angry]] [[with]] [[me]]. [[Please]] [[tell]] [[him]] [[that]] [[a]] [[brother]] [[is|be]] [[never]] [[really]] an [[enemy]]. [[Your]] [[son]], Son.\``,`vn`:`\`B\u1ed1 k\u00ednh y\u00eau, con xin l\u1ed7i v\u00ec nh\u1eefng l\u1eddi con \u0111\u00e3 n\u00f3i v\u1edbi anh H\u00f9ng. C\u1ea3 hai anh em \u0111\u1ec1u n\u00f3ng gi\u1eadn, v\u00e0 gi\u1edd c\u1ea3 hai \u0111\u1ec1u qu\u00e1 s\u0129 di\u1ec7n. Con c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t tin vui. Con \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u00ednh h\u00f4n v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t c\u00f4 g\u00e1i t\u1ed1t b\u1ee5ng \u1edf v\u00f9ng n\u00fai. Con mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u01b0a c\u00f4 \u1ea5y v\u1ec1 ra m\u1eaft c\u1ea3 nh\u00e0, nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i khi anh H\u00f9ng c\u00f2n gi\u1eadn con. B\u1ed1 h\u00e3y n\u00f3i v\u1edbi anh \u1ea5y r\u1eb1ng anh em th\u00ec ch\u1eb3ng bao gi\u1edd l\u00e0 k\u1ebb th\u00f9 th\u1eadt s\u1ef1. Con c\u1ee7a b\u1ed1, S\u01a1n.\``},{`en`:`\`[[Why]] [[did|do]] [[they]] [[argue]]?\` [[asked|ask]] Ngoc. \`[[Something]] [[small]] [[that]] [[became|become]] [[big]],\` [[said|say]] Grandpa. \`[[In]] [[his]] [[youth]], [[your]] [[dad]] [[got|get]] [[angry]] [[fast]], [[and]] Son [[was|be]] [[the]] [[same]]. [[All]] [[our]] [[relations|relation]] [[are|be]] [[here]] [[this]] [[week]], [[except]] [[one]].\` [[He]] [[looked|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[photo]] [[for]] [[a]] [[long]] [[time]]. [[Then]] [[he]] [[gave|give]] Ngoc [[a]] [[kiss]] [[on]] [[the]] [[top]] [[of]] [[her]] [[head]] [[and]] [[went|go]] [[to]] [[make]] [[tea]].`,`vn`:`\`Sao b\u1ed1 v\u1edbi ch\u00fa l\u1ea1i c\u00e3i nhau \u1ea1?\` Ng\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi. \`Chuy\u1ec7n nh\u1ecf m\u00e0 th\u00e0nh to th\u00f4i,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \`H\u1ed3i tr\u1ebb, b\u1ed1 ch\u00e1u n\u00f3ng t\u00ednh l\u1eafm, m\u00e0 ch\u00fa S\u01a1n c\u0169ng ch\u1eb3ng k\u00e9m. Tu\u1ea7n n\u00e0y h\u1ecd h\u00e0ng nh\u00e0 m\u00ecnh v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ee7 c\u1ea3, ch\u1ec9 thi\u1ebfu m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi.\` \u00d4ng nh\u00ecn t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh